<http://bimerr.iot.linkeddata.es/def/building#BuildingSpace> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                                             rdfs:comment "Class to represent the different spaces the building have and where the occupant behaviors occur.";
                                                             rdfs:label "Space"@en;
